%% Diagram: Evidence-Grounded Retrieval and Generation
%% ID: ECOMDY-D23 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal; no RAG runtime implemented
flowchart LR
  sources["Permitted source versions, claims and citations"] --> index["Knowledge store + metadata / access filters"]
  index --> search["Scoped retrieval · full-text baseline"]
  index -. optional only after evaluation .-> vector["Vector retrieval candidate"]
  auth -. scoped query to optional vector retrieval .-> vector
  vector --> context["Relevant evidence context"]
  search --> context
  user["Authenticated user question"] --> auth["Authorization and scope check"] --> search
  context --> model["Task-scoped provider · not selected"]
  model --> answer["Draft answer with claim-to-source links"]
  answer --> validate["Citation / unsupported-claim validation"]
  validate --> outcome{"Evidence sufficient?"}
  outcome -->|Yes| response["Cited response for review"]
  outcome -->|No| insufficient["Explicit insufficient-evidence response"]
